  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, do not give the genealogy of my fathers in this part of my record;",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.753,
      "end": 8.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither at any time shall I give it after",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.627,
      "end": 11.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon these plates which I am writing;",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.222,
      "end": 15.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it is given in the record which has been kept by my father;",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.721,
      "end": 18.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I do not write it in this work.",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.816,
      "end": 22.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it sufficeth me to say that we are descendants of Joseph.",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 23.025,
      "end": 24.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it mattereth not to me",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.97,
      "end": 29.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I am particular to give a full account of all the things of my father,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.84,
      "end": 32.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they cannot be written upon these plates,",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.76,
      "end": 34.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I desire the room",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 34.565,
      "end": 36.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may write of the things of God.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 37.66,
      "end": 43.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the fulness of mine intent is that I may persuade men to come unto the God of Abraham,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 43.831,
      "end": 45.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the God of Isaac,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 45.683,
      "end": 47.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the God of Jacob,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 47.721,
      "end": 49.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be saved.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 49.841,
      "end": 55.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the things which are pleasing unto the world I do not write,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 55.362,
      "end": 58.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the things which are pleasing unto God",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 58.561,
      "end": 61.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto those who are not of the world.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 61.702,
      "end": 65.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I shall give commandment unto my seed,",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 65.365,
      "end": 68.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they shall not occupy these plates with things",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 68.842,
      "end": 71.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are not of worth unto the children of men.",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    }
  ]
}